      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The purpose of the work was an analysis of the causes of recurrent abdominal pain in children treated in the Paediatric Department, Province Hospital in Rzeszów in the years 1975-1991. The analysis included 3480 children (59.3% girls and 40.7% boys) aged 6-16 years. The causes of recurrent abdominal pain were gastrointestinal tract diseases (45.7%), urinary system diseases (36.8%), extra-abdominal diseases (6.4%), psychogenic background (11%)."},
